===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:[[wel]], [[wal]], [[wol]], [[wele]]<ety:inh<ang:wel<ety:inh<gem-pro:*wela>>>>|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|wel}}, {{m|enm|wal}}, {{m|enm|wol}}, {{m|enm|wele}}, from {{inh|en|ang|wel|t=well, abundantly, very, very easily, very much, fully, quite, nearly}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*wela}}, {{m|gem-pro|*wala|t=well|lit=as wished, as desired}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*welh₁-|t=wish, desire}}.
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|yol|vella}}, {{m|yol|waal}}, {{m|yol|wel}}, {{m|yol|well}}, {{m|yol|wull|t=well}}, {{cog|cim|boll}}, {{m|cim|bóol|t=well}}, {{cog|nl|wel|t=well}}, {{cog|de|wohl}}, {{m|de|wol}}, {{m|de|woll|t=well}}, {{cog|da,is,nb,nn|vel|t=well}}, {{cog|fo|væl|t=well}}, {{cog|sv|väl}}, {{m|sv|waͤl|t=well}}, {{cog|got|𐍅𐌰𐌹𐌻𐌰|t=well}}. Related to {{l|en|will}}.
{{col-bottom}}

